# Route: guide 19 of 50 of the simulator's completionist route for Skyborne
# (1291 of 1301 eligible quests, 161.8 h, world baeac23fbe5e): levels 40 to
# 44, 64 quests, 12.5 h under the model. The order is the simulator's (`sim
# run --objective completionist`, then `sim export`; docs/SIMULATION.md §10):
# fix a step in the exporter or the data, not only here, so the next export
# keeps it.
#
# Flow (Stranglethorn Vale): Nesingwary's Expedition -> Lake Nazferiti ->
# Kurzen's Compound -> Nesingwary's Expedition -> Kal'ai Ruins -> Nesingwary's
# Expedition -> Ruins of Zul'Kunda -> The Vile Reef -> Nesingwary's Expedition
# -> Grom'gol Base Camp -> Nesingwary's Expedition -> Mosh'Ogg Ogre Mound ->
# Nesingwary's Expedition -> ….
#
# Optional (elite: grouping up is advised): Encrusted Tail Fins (1107;
# Saltscale Warrior 35-36, Saltscale Oracle 36-37, Saltscale Tide Lord 37,
# Saltscale Forager 35-36, Saltscale Hunter 35-36); Panther Mastery (193;
# Bhag'thera 40); Raptor Mastery (197; Tethis 43); Big Game Hunter (208; King
# Bangalash 43); The Mind's Eye (591; Mai'Zoth 47); Cracking Maury's Foot
# (613; Mosh'Ogg Mauler 43-44, Mosh'Ogg Shaman 43-44, Mosh'Ogg Lord 45,
# Mosh'Ogg Warmonger 41-42, Mosh'Ogg Spellcrafter 43-44, Mosh'Ogg Butcher 44);
# The Monogrammed Sash (620; Mok'rash 50); The Captain's Chest (8551; Gorlash
# 47); Excelsior (628; Elder Saltwater Crocolisk 38).
#
# Left to other guides: class quests (the Class category).

